    <string name="explore_guide_title">Bulk Screenshot Splitter Guide</string>
    <string name="explore_guide_body">This app is designed to help you split large text files, log outputs, or code source files into multiple high-resolution screenshot images.\n\nTo avoid cluttering your storage with hundreds of separate images, each file\'s screenshots are bundled directly into a compressed ZIP file.\n\nAll results are saved inside your device\'s public Documents directory: /Documents/BulkScreenshotSplitter/{FolderPrefix}/</string>
